  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would result in an asymmetric roof form that is overly dominant and wholly unsympathetic to the character of the host property and the wider streetscene to their detriment. Furthermore, the proposed porch is to project beyond the existing bay window line and is considered to be an overly dominant addition to the front elevation along with a design that is not sympathetic to the character of the surrounding area. Subsequently, the proposal is considered to be contrary to local plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 and the aims and objectives of Part A5 (Residential Extension Guidelines) of the adopted Hounslow Character Sustainability and Design Codes SPD \r\n"
